This problem mainly tests the rules of the symmetric points of any point in the rectangular coordinate system about the coordinate axes and coordinate planes. It is a basic question. According to the problem, find the symmetric points about the coordinate axes and coordinate planes respectively based on the characteristics of the rectangular coordinate system, and then determine whether they are correct.

