Solution: The symmetric point of $P$ about the $x$-axis is $P_{1}(x, -y, -z)$;
The symmetric point of $P$ about the $yOz$ plane is $P_{2}(-x, y, z)$;
The symmetric point of $P$ about the $y$-axis is $P_{3}(-x, y, -z)$;
The coordinates of the point symmetric to point $P$ about the origin are $P_{4}(-x, -y, -z)$.

